       }
      },
      "content": [
       {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "Fluoxetine, sertraline, escitalopram, citalopram, paroxetine, fluvoxamine"
       }
      ]
     },
     {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "attrs": {
       "indLeft": 0,
       "indRight": 0,
       "indFirst": 0,
       "spaceBefore": 0,
       "spaceAfter": 0,
       "line": null,
       "align": "left",
       "shade": null,
       "borders": null,
       "marker": {
        "text": "•",
        "font": null,
        "marks": [],
        "tabPt": 12
       }
      },
      "content": [
       {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "First line treatment for MDD, all anxiety disorders (GAD, OCD, PTSD, social anxiety disorder)"
       }
      ]
     },
     {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "attrs": {
       "indLeft": 0,
       "indRight": 0,
       "indFirst": 0,
       "spaceBefore": 0,
       "spaceAfter": 0,
       "line": null,
       "align": "left",
       "shade": null,
       "borders": null,
       "marker": {
        "text": "•",
        "font": null,
        "marks": [],
        "tabPt": 12
       }
      },
      "content": [
       {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "Risk causing mania"
       }
      ]
     },
     {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "attrs": {
       "indLeft": 0,
       "indRight": 0,
       "indFirst": 0,
       "spaceBefore": 0,
       "spaceAfter": 0,
       "line": null,
       "align": "left",
       "shade": null,
       "borders": null,
       "marker": {
        "text": "•",
        "font": null,
        "marks": [],
        "tabPt": 12
       }
      },
      "content": [
       {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "Generally benign side effect profile – headache, sexual dysfunction, GI side effects"
       }
      ]
     },
     {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "attrs": {
       "indLeft": 0,
       "indRight": 0,
       "indFirst": 0,
       "spaceBefore": 0,
       "spaceAfter": 0,
       "line": null,
       "align": "left",
       "shade": null,
       "borders": null,
       "marker": {
        "text": "•",
        "font": null,
        "marks": [],
        "tabPt": 12
       }
      },
      "content": [
       {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "Relatively low risk of serotonin syndrome in OD. "
       }
      ]
     },
     {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "attrs": {
       "indLeft": 18,
       "indRight": 0,
       "indFirst": 0,
       "spaceBefore": 0,
       "spaceAfter": 0,
       "line": null,
       "align": "left",
       "shade": null,
       "borders": null,
       "marker": {
        "text": "•",
        "font": null,
        "marks": [],
        "tabPt": 12
       }
      },
      "content": [
       {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "Exams love to give you serotonin syndrome questions where a patient is receiving amitriptyline/nortriptyline for neuropathy"
       }
      ]
     },
     {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "attrs": {
       "indLeft": 0,
       "indRight": 0,
       "indFirst": 0,
       "spaceBefore": 0,
       "spaceAfter": 0,
       "line": null,
       "align": "left",
       "shade": null,
       "borders": null,
       "marker": {
        "text": "•",
        "font": null,
        "marks": [],
        "tabPt": 12
       }
      },
      "content": [
       {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "Specific important points about SSRIs"
       }
      ]
     },
     {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "attrs": {
       "indLeft": 18,
       "indRight": 0,
       "indFirst": 0,
       "spaceBefore": 0,
       "spaceAfter": 0,
       "line": null,
       "align": "left",
       "shade": null,
       "borders": null,
       "marker": {
        "text": "•",
        "font": null,
        "marks": [],
        "tabPt": 12
       }
      },
      "content": [
       {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "Fluvoxamine is only approved to treat OCD. Usually do not see this as an answer choice."
       }
      ]
     },
     {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "attrs": {
       "indLeft": 18,
       "indRight": 0,
       "indFirst": 0,
       "spaceBefore": 0,
       "spaceAfter": 0,
       "line": null,
       "align": "left",
       "shade": null,
       "borders": null,
       "marker": {
        "text": "•",
        "font": null,
        "marks": [],
        "tabPt": 12
       }
      },
      "content": [
       {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "Paroxetine – do not use in pregnancy! Higher than normal risk of persistent pulmonary hypertension of the newborn, hypoplastic right heart syndrome"
       }
      ]
     },
     {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "attrs": {
       "indLeft": 18,
       "indRight": 0,
       "indFirst": 0,
       "spaceBefore": 0,
       "spaceAfter": 0,
       "line": null,
       "align": "left",
       "shade": null,
       "borders": null,
       "marker": {
        "text": "•",
        "font": null,
        "marks": [],
        "tabPt": 12
       }
      },
      "content": [
       {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "Fluoxetine – longest half-life (1 week). If fluoxetine is being discontinued to start MAOi, need to wait 5 weeks!"
       }
      ]
     },
     {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "attrs": {
       "indLeft": 36,
       "indRight": 0,
       "indFirst": 0,
       "spaceBefore": 0,
       "spaceAfter": 0,
       "line": null,
       "align": "left",
       "shade": null,
       "borders": null,
       "marker": {
        "text": "•",
        "font": null,
        "marks": [],
        "tabPt": 12
       }
      },
      "content": [
       {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "Also interacts strongly with warfarin, increases bleeding risk"
       }
      ]
     },
     {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "attrs": {
       "indLeft": 0,
       "indRight": 0,
       "indFirst": 0,
       "spaceBefore": 0,
       "spaceAfter": 0,
       "line": null,
       "align": "left",
       "shade": null,
       "borders": null,
       "marker": {
        "text": "•",
        "font": null,
        "marks": [],
        "tabPt": 12
       }
      },
      "content": [
       {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "Otherwise, few reasons the test will ask you to pick between SSRIs as they’re equally effective."
       }
      ]
